","icon":"/enemies-icons/Shadow Scholar.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A character often seen in Yanese shadow plays, prone to strange encounters in those plays. This Shadowgeist has seen these scenes play out so many times that it believes them to be real, and even warning of the talismans is not enough to dissuade it.","abilities":["When HP drops below a certain level, absorbs a nearby <Talisman> and recovers HP"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":13000,"atk":350,"def":50,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2}},"bottle_swordsman":{"slug":"bottle_swordsman","name":"Bottle Swordsman","icon":"/enemies-icons/Bottle Swordsman.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Once a wandering physician's medicine bottle, it provided healing to many warriors. When it became a geist, it was moved by a talisman and put the talisman in its bottle, embarking on a journey of chivalry.","abilities":["Starts with 3 <Talismans>; attacks attach a <Talisman> to the target when carrying a <Talisman>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":14000,"atk":500,"def":400,"res":30,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":4}},"mirror_tianshi":{"slug":"mirror_tianshi","name":"Mirror Tianshi","icon":"/enemies-icons/Mirror Tianshi.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A well-polished mirror that believes it sees everything clearly. When it became a Geist, it was not content with just seeing things, but could not stop itself from giving unsolicited advice, just like the old scholars in the Tianshi Bureau.","abilities":["Picks a target from very long range, dealing Arts da